{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t秘魯發生6.7級地震，首都利馬等地震感強烈。<br/>\n<br/>\n地震發生在當地星期五晚，震央位於胡寧省胡寧市西北30公里，震源深度129公里。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T01:23:51.182458+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":69,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:02:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:32.009338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T01:17:22.076271+00:00","content_hash":"afc4e536cab155e3436d2e36858cbc5a1b286a86fcb9ab75f717a02d9b9f713f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}